<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. The previous editor, Dr. Orion, <a href="/convergence">failed to provide an explanation for how this is fatal</a>. I have left it here regardless as it is important information <em>-Dr. Oswald</em></div>
